  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pue7Uy5.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;<br>\n![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252fCOMPATIBLE-FORGE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/badge/COMPATIBLE-FORGE</a> &amp; FABRIC-E04E14?labelColor=2D2D2D&amp;style=for-the-badge)<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/REQUIRES-ARCHITECTURY-E04E14?labelColor=2D2D2D&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></p><p><strong>FindMe</strong> 讓你可以透過按鍵搜尋附近容器中的物品。你只需要將滑鼠懸停在物品上（支援 JEI）並按下「<strong>Y</strong>」（預設按鍵），就會在有該物品的容器上方生成雲霧粒子效果。</p><p>它還允許你透過按下數字鍵盤的 <strong>0</strong> 或 <strong>1</strong> 鍵從附近容器中<strong>提取</strong>物品。0 鍵會給你 1 個物品，而 1 鍵會給你一組。</p><p>搜尋範圍可以在<strong>設定檔</strong>中調整。</p><p>此模組需要同時安裝在<strong>客戶端與伺服器</strong>上。</p><p>此功能基於 <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/extra-utilities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extra Utilities 2</a> 的搜尋功能。</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2n2onOS.gif\" alt=\"\"></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn.worldvectorlogo.com%252flogos%252fdiscord.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://cdn.worldvectorlogo.com/logos/discord.svg</a>)&nbsp;[Discord](<a href=\"https://discord.gg/4tPfwjn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/4tPfwjn</a>)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.djmaclennan.com%252fwp-content%252fuploads%252f2017%252f06%252fpatreon_logo.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.djmaclennan.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/patreon_logo.png</a>)&nbsp;[Patreon](<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/buuz135\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/buuz135</a>) &nbsp; &nbsp; ![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcdn3.iconfinder.com%252fdata%252ficons%252fsocial-icons-5%252f606%252fTwitter.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://cdn3.iconfinder.com/data/icons/social-icons-5/606/Twitter.png</a>) [Twitter](<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Buuz135mods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://twitter.com/Buuz135mods</a>)</p>",
